stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> HEALTHY
    HEALTHY --> DEGRADED: a failure that counts
    DEGRADED --> HEALTHY: a success
    DEGRADED --> UNHEALTHY: threshold reached, the circuit opens
    UNHEALTHY --> RECOVERING: the open period elapsed
    RECOVERING --> HEALTHY: the trial call succeeds
    RECOVERING --> UNHEALTHY: the trial call fails
